  "body": "Positioned in a prime location between Orewa and Hatfields Beach, this boutique development offers a rare blend of coastal luxury and tranquil seclusion. Elevated to capture sweeping sea views and surrounded by lush native bush, these private sections provide the ultimate canvas for your dream home.\r\n\r\nSecure all five sites as an exclusive package or choose from individual lots ranging from a generous 975 sqm to 2,050 sqm. Featuring designated, design-ready building platforms. Enjoy a peaceful, sheltered lifestyle without sacrificing convenience—with vibrant cafes, top schools, and pristine beaches in Orewa right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nBoutique land packages in this coveted location are exceptionally rare.\r\n\r\nCall today to secure your slice of coastal paradise!",
